# 🔐 AWS Automated Key Remediation

An AWS security automation project designed to rapidly disable compromised IAM access keys, reducing the time an exposed credential remains usable.

## 🚨 Security Problem

Compromised AWS access keys can allow unauthorized users to authenticate to AWS and perform actions based on the permissions assigned to the identity.

If a compromised credential remains active, an attacker may have more time to access resources or perform malicious API actions.

This project demonstrates how AWS IAM access-key remediation can be automated using Python and AWS services.

